DESCRIPTION=Unified in-flight channel sidecar (fl_channel_sidecar_t) for file and message transfers: 5-byte MSB-first prefix, share/transfer id, expires_at, sender/receiver member ids, center_freq_hz (#279 hook), FILE_META/MSG_META wire rev 1; host relay strips in-flight sidecar; clients emit MSG_META before MSG; catalog pending/commit for message sidecar; host SQLite catalog (server_shared/host_catalog.db) with SHA-256 content-hash fetch, per-transfer_id member ACL (duplicate content_hash allowed), full-blob read enforcement, public/expiry/revoke for hub file and message storage; server_shared lands offered file_name (numeric (n) suffix on collision), host <landed>.meta for share_id/expiry purge into expired/; catalog checkpoint on host promote and import_handoff; server file fetch by hash allocates full payload; fl_net_endpoint_t parse/bind/connect (#280 hosted dual-stack foundation: native IPv6 bracket parse, v6 loopback host/join, endpoint-aware sockets); fl_net_server_addr_t peer_addr on members (#283); OP_CTRL_HOST_PROMOTE6 (0x24) client dispatch, native-v6 successor emit, and promote reconnect (#283); session wire big-endian norm (#284), fl_net_htons/htonl in net_udp/net_background/tests; OP_CTRL_HOST_PROMOTE memcpy/nbo decode (#284); session_mutex guards promote without blocking under lock (#285); Python host_catalog.db integration test; tracks #239 server file/msg hub

